ppened.","28:12":"And after the chief priests had met with the elders and formed a plan, they gave the soldiers a large sum of money","28:13":"and instructed them: “You are to say, ‘His disciples came by night and stole Him away while we were asleep.’","28:14":"If this report reaches the governor, we will satisfy him and keep you out of trouble.”","28:15":"So the guards took the money and did as they were instructed. And this account has been circulated among the Jews to this very day."}}},"pairs":{},"minor":[]}